{"cantica":"inferno","cantoNumber":12,"title":"Canto XII","totalDuration":341.92,"segments":[{"id":1,"speaker":"narrator","text":"The place where we came down to descend the bank\nwas like an alpine cliff, and what lay there\nwould make any eye recoil in horror.","startTime":0,"endTime":8.32,"words":[{"word":"The","start":0.081,"end":0.361},{"word":"place","start":0.361,"end":0.561},{"word":"where","start":0.561,"end":0.801},{"word":"we","start":0.801,"end":1.001},{"word":"came","start":1.001,"end":1.241},{"word":"down","start":1.241,"end":1.441},{"word":"to","start":1.441,"end":1.641},{"word":"descend","start":1.641,"end":1.921},{"word":"the","start":1.921,"end":2.081},{"word":"bank","start":2.081,"end":2.481},{"word":"was","start":2.481,"end":2.721},{"word":"like","start":2.721,"end":2.921},{"word":"an","start":2.921,"end":3.121},{"word":"alpine","start":3.121,"end":3.681},{"word":"cliff,","start":3.681,"end":4.641},{"word":"and","start":4.641,"end":4.881},{"word":"what","start":4.881,"end":5.041},{"word":"lay","start":5.041,"end":5.281},{"word":"there","start":5.281,"end":5.601},{"word":"would","start":5.601,"end":5.841},{"word":"make","start":5.841,"end":6.081},{"word":"any","start":6.081,"end":6.401},{"word":"eye","start":6.401,"end":6.761},{"word":"recoil","start":6.761,"end":7.361},{"word":"in","start":7.361,"end":7.601},{"word":"horror.","start":7.601,"end":8.32}]},{"id":2,"speaker":"narrator","text":"The destruction there was of such a kind\nthat every eye would turn away in horror.\nLike that landslide which struck the Adige's flank\non this side of Trent—whether by earthquake\nor failing foundation—where the mountainside\nshattered from peak to plain in such a way\nit might provide a path for those above,\nso was the descent of that ravine.\nAnd there upon the edge of the broken chasm\nlay stretched the infamy of Crete,\nconceived within that counterfeit cow.\nWhen he saw us, he bit himself\nlike one consumed by inner rage.\nMy guide shouted toward him: \"Perhaps\nyou think the Duke of Athens stands here,\nwho brought your death in the world above?\nGet away, beast! This man comes not\ntutored by your sister, but travels here\nto witness all your punishments.\"\nLike a bull that breaks loose the moment\nit receives the killing blow,\nunable to walk but staggering everywhere,\nso I watched the Minotaur react.\nMy guide, alert, cried: \"Run to the passage!\nWhile he rages, you'd better get down.\"\nSo we descended over that rockfall,\nstones that often shifted beneath my feet\nunder this unaccustomed weight.\nI walked deep in thought, and he said:","startTime":8.32,"endTime":77.28,"words":[{"word":"The","start":8.401,"end":8.561},{"word":"destruction","start":8.561,"end":9.201},{"word":"there","start":9.201,"end":9.521},{"word":"was","start":9.521,"end":9.721},{"word":"of","start":9.721,"end":9.921},{"word":"such","start":9.921,"end":10.161},{"word":"a","start":10.161,"end":10.428},{"word":"kind","start":10.428,"end":10.681},{"word":"that","start":10.681,"end":10.881},{"word":"every","start":10.881,"end":11.361},{"word":"eye","start":11.361,"end":11.681},{"word":"would","start":11.681,"end":11.841},{"word":"turn","start":11.841,"end":12.161},{"word":"away","start":12.161,"end":12.521},{"word":"in","start":12.521,"end":12.761},{"word":"horror.","start":12.761,"end":13.761},{"word":"Like","start":13.761,"end":14.001},{"word":"that","start":14.001,"end":14.161},{"word":"landslide","start":14.161,"end":14.921},{"word":"which","start":14.921,"end":15.121},{"word":"struck","start":15.121,"end":15.361},{"word":"the","start":15.361,"end":15.521},{"word":"Adige's","start":15.521,"end":16.041},{"word":"flank","start":16.041,"end":16.401},{"word":"on","start":16.401,"end":16.561},{"word":"this","start":16.561,"end":16.721},{"word":"side","start":16.721,"end":16.961},{"word":"of","start":16.961,"end":17.081},{"word":"Trent—whether","start":17.081,"end":18.041},{"word":"by","start":18.041,"end":18.281},{"word":"earthquake","start"