ch some believe the world\nhas often been converted into chaos.\nAt that moment this ancient rock,\nhere and elsewhere, collapsed.","startTime":77.28,"endTime":115.6,"words":[{"word":"You're","start":77.28,"end":77.52},{"word":"thinking","start":77.52,"end":77.84},{"word":"about","start":77.84,"end":78.2},{"word":"this","start":78.2,"end":78.48},{"word":"ruin,","start":78.48,"end":79.32},{"word":"perhaps,","start":79.32,"end":80.08},{"word":"guarded","start":80.08,"end":80.56},{"word":"by","start":80.56,"end":80.76},{"word":"that","start":80.76,"end":81.04},{"word":"bestial","start":81.04,"end":81.76},{"word":"fury","start":81.76,"end":82.24},{"word":"I","start":82.24,"end":82.4},{"word":"just","start":82.4,"end":82.64},{"word":"subdued.","start":82.64,"end":84.08},{"word":"Know","start":84.08,"end":84.48},{"word":"this—the","start":84.48,"end":85.36},{"word":"other","start":85.36,"end":85.76},{"word":"time","start":85.76,"end":85.92},{"word":"I","start":85.92,"end":86.16},{"word":"descended","start":86.16,"end":86.56},{"word":"to","start":86.56,"end":86.64},{"word":"the","start":86.64,"end":86.96},{"word":"depths","start":86.96,"end":87.2},{"word":"of","start":87.2,"end":87.6},{"word":"Hell,","start":87.6,"end":88.24},{"word":"this","start":88.24,"end":88.48},{"word":"cliff","start":88.48,"end":88.96},{"word":"had","start":88.96,"end":89.2},{"word":"not","start":89.2,"end":89.44},{"word":"yet","start":89.44,"end":89.76},{"word":"fallen.","start":89.76,"end":90.64},{"word":"But","start":90.64,"end":90.8},{"word":"truly,","start":90.8,"end":91.6},{"word":"if","start":91.6,"end":91.76},{"word":"I","start":91.76,"end":92},{"word":"discern","start":92,"end":92.64},{"word":"correctly,","start":92.64,"end":93.36},{"word":"a","start":93.36,"end":93.6},{"word":"little","start":93.6,"end":93.92},{"word":"before","start":93.92,"end":94.16},{"word":"He","start":94.16,"end":94.56},{"word":"came","start":94.56,"end":94.8},{"word":"who","start":94.8,"end":94.96},{"word":"carried","start":94.96,"end":95.36},{"word":"off","start":95.36,"end":95.44},{"word":"the","start":95.44,"end":95.84},{"word":"mighty","start":95.84,"end":96.16},{"word":"spoil","start":96.16,"end":96.64},{"word":"from","start":96.64,"end":97.12},{"word":"Dis","start":97.12,"end":97.2},{"word":"in","start":97.2,"end":97.36},{"word":"the","start":97.36,"end":97.76},{"word":"highest","start":97.76,"end":98.24},{"word":"circle,","start":98.24,"end":98.8},{"word":"the","start":98.8,"end":99.28},{"word":"deep","start":99.28,"end":99.44},{"word":"and","start":99.44,"end":99.6},{"word":"loathsome","start":99.6,"end":100.32},{"word":"valley","start":100.32,"end":100.64},{"word":"trembled","start":100.64,"end":101.28},{"word":"on","start":101.28,"end":101.52},{"word":"all","start":101.52,"end":101.88},{"word":"sides","start":101.88,"end":102.32},{"word":"so","start":102.32,"end":102.72},{"word":"violently","start":102.72,"end":103.6},{"word":"I","start":103.6,"end":103.84},{"word":"thought","start":103.84,"end":103.92},{"word":"the","start":103.92,"end":104.16},{"word":"universe","start":104.16,"end":104.72},{"word":"was","start":104.72,"end":105.28},{"word":"moved","start":105.28,"end":105.44},{"word":"by","start":105.44,"end":106},{"word":"love—","start":106,"end":106.56},{"word":"by","start":106.56,"end":106.88},{"word":"which","start":106.88,"end":107.12},{"word":"some","start":107.12,"end":107.28},{"word":"believe","start":107.28,"end":107.6},{"word":"the","start":107.6,"end":108},{"word":"world","start":108,"end":108.16},{"word":"has","start":108.16,"end":108.56},{"word":"often","start":108.56,"end":108.8},{"word":"been","start":108.8,"end":109.28},{"word":"converted","start":109.28,"end":109.52},{"word":"into","start":109.52,"end":109.84},{"word":"chaos.","start":109.84,"end":110.88},{"word":"At","start":110.88,"end":111.12},{"word":"that","start":111.12,"end":111.6},{"word":"moment","start":111.6,"end":112},{"word":"this","start":112,"end":112.32},{"word":"ancient","start":112.32,"end":112.96},{"word":"rock,","start":112.96,"end":113.52},{"word":"here","start":113.52,"end":113.76},{"word":"and","start":113.76,"end":114.08},{"word":"elsewhere,","start":114.08,"end":115.36},{"word":"collapsed.","start":115.36,"end":115.6}]},{"id":4,"speaker":"virgil","text":"But fix your eyes below, for now\nthe river of blood draws near,\nin which boils everyone who does\nviolence to others.","startTime":115.6,"endTime":124.32,"words":[{"word":"But","start":115.6,"end":115.84},{"word":"fix","start":115.84,"end":116.16},{"word":"your","start":116.16,"end":116.32},{"word":"eyes","start":116.32,"end":116.64},{"word":"below,","start":116.64,"end":117.68},{"word":"for","start":117.68,"end":117.92},{"word":"now","start":117.92,"end":118.28},{"word":"the","start":118.28,"end":118.48},{"word":"river","start":118.48,"end":118.88},{"word":"of","start":118.88,"end":119.04},{"word":"blood","start":119.04,"end":119.52},{"word":"draws","start":119.52,"end":120},{"word":"near,","start":120,"end":120.8},{"word":"in","start":120.8,"end":120.96},{"word":"which","start":120.96,"end":121.2},{"word":"boils","start":121.2,"end":121.76},{"word":"everyone","start":121.76,"end":122.4},{"word":"who","start":122.4,"end":122.56},{"word":"does","start":122.56,"end":122.88},{"word":"violence","start":122.88,"end":123.44},{"word":"to","start":123.44,"end":123.6},{"word":"others.","start":123.6,"end":124.32}]},{"id":5,"speaker":"narrator","text":"Oh blind greed! Oh insane wrath\nthat drives us forward in our brief life\nand then steeps us so wretchedly in eternity!\nI saw a wide moat curved like a bow\nthat embraced the entire plain,\njust as my guide had said.\nBetween the moat and the embankment's base\ncentaurs ran in single file, armed with arrows,\nas they used to hunt on earth.\nSeeing us descend, each one stopped,\nand three detached themselves from the squadron,\nbows and arrows ready in advance.\nOne shouted from afar: \"What torment\nare you heading for, descending that slope?\nTell us from there—or I draw my bow!\"\nMy master said: \"We'll give our answer\nto Chiron there beside you.\nYour hasty will was always your misfortune.\"\nThen he touched me and said: \"That's Nessus,\nwho died for beautiful Dejanira\nand took his own revenge.\nThe one in the middle, gazing at his chest,\nis great Chiron, who raised Achilles.\nThe other is Pholus, full of rage.\nThousands and thousands circle the moat,\nshooting arrows at any soul that emerges\nfrom the blood more than his sin allows.\"\nWe approached those swift creatures.\nChiron took an arrow and with its notch\npushed back his beard upon his jaw.\nWhen he'd uncovered his great mouth,\nhe said to his companions: \"Have you noticed\nthat the one behind moves whatever he touches?\nThe feet of the dead don't usually do that.\"\nMy good guide, now at Chiron's breast\nwhere the two natures join together,\nreplied: \"He is indeed alive, and I alone\nmust show him the dark valley.\nNecessity, not pleasure, drives us.\nSomeone who was singing hallelujah\ngave me this new duty.\nHe's no thief, and I'm no criminal spirit.\nBut by the power that moves my steps\nalong this savage road,\ngive us one of your own to accompany us,\nto show us where to cross the ford\nand carry this one on his back—\nhe's no spirit that can walk on air.\"\nChiron wheeled around to his right side\nand said to Nessus: \"Go back and guide them,\nand warn off any other band you meet.\"\nWe moved forward with our faithful escort\nalong the bank of the boiling crimson tide\nwhere the boiled uttered piercing screams.\nI saw people sunk up to their eyebrows,\nand the great centaur said: \"These are tyrants\nwho dealt in bloodshed and plunder.\nHere they lament their merciless crimes.\nHere is Alexander, and fierce Dionysius\nwho brought Sicily years of anguish.\nThat forehead with the black hair is Azzolino,\nand the blond one is Obizzo of Este,\nwho was truly murdered by his stepson\nin the world above.\"\nThen I turned to my guid